  m_text: "Movement: WASD (UP, DOWN, LEFT, RIGHT)\r\n\r\nSelect Inventory Slot: Left
    Mouse Click on Inventory Slot\r\n\r\nUse Item (E) - Select Inventory Slot, then
    press (E)\r\nDrop Item (Q) - Select Inventory Slot, then press (Q)\r\n\r\nInteract
    (E) \r\n\r\nExit (ESC) - Open Pause Menu \r\n\r\nNext Dialogue (ENTER / Left
    Mouse Click)\n"
