  m_text: 'World Items can only be interacted with once per day. Advancing to the
    next day resets World Items to be interacted with again.


    A dropped item
    will disappear when it''s a new day. Chests are exempt from this.


    You cannot
    craft items in a full inventory even if some materials in the full inventory
    will be consumed





'
